## Authentication
All endpoints require authentication using a Bearer token in the Authorization header:
```
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
```

## User Profile
Router: `/users`

### Create User Profile
`POST /users`

Creates a new user profile in the system.

#### Request Body
```json
{
    "last_name": "string",
    "first_name": "string",
    "middle_name": "string",
    "username": "string",
    "timezone": "string"  // Format: "America/New_York"
}
```

#### Response (201 Created)
```json
{
    "id": "string",
    "last_name": "string",
    "first_name": "string",
    "middle_name": "string",
    "username": "string",
    "timezone": "string",
    "created_at": "ISO8601 datetime",
    "updated_at": "ISO8601 datetime"
}
```

#### Error Responses
- 400 Bad Request: Invalid input data
- 409 Conflict: Username already exists
- 500 Internal Server Error: Server error

### Get User Profile
`GET /users/me`

Retrieves the authenticated user's profile.

#### Response (200 OK)
```json
{
    "id": "string",
    "last_name": "string",
    "first_name": "string",
    "middle_name": "string",
    "username": "string",
    "timezone": "string",
    "created_at": "ISO8601 datetime",
    "updated_at": "ISO8601 datetime"
}
```

#### Error Responses
- 401 Unauthorized: Invalid or missing authentication
- 404 Not Found: User profile not found
- 500 Internal Server Error: Server error

## Audio Snippets
Router: `/snippets`

### Create Snippet Job
`POST /snippets`

Creates a new job to generate audio snippets based on the user's request.

#### Request Body
```json
{
    "request_text": "string"  // User's request for audio snippets
}
```

#### Response (202 Accepted)
```json
{
    "job_ids": ["string"],  // List of job IDs created
    "status": "pending",
    "estimated_completion_time": "ISO8601 datetime"
}
```

#### Error Responses
- 400 Bad Request: Invalid request text
- 401 Unauthorized: Invalid or missing authentication
- 500 Internal Server Error: Server error

### Get Job Status
`GET /snippets/jobs/{job_id}`

Retrieves the status and details of a specific job.

#### Response (200 OK)
```json
{
    "job_id": "string",
    "status": "pending|processing|completed|failed",
    "progress": "number",  // 0-100
    "created_at": "ISO8601 datetime",
    "updated_at": "ISO8601 datetime",
    "error_message": "string",  // Only present if status is failed
    "snippet_ids": ["string"]   // Only present if status is completed
}
```

#### Error Responses
- 401 Unauthorized: Invalid or missing authentication
- 404 Not Found: Job not found
- 500 Internal Server Error: Server error

### Get Audio Snippet
`GET /snippets/{snippet_id}`

Streams the audio content of a specific snippet.

#### Response (200 OK)
- Content-Type: audio/mpeg
- Streams the audio content

#### Error Responses
- 401 Unauthorized: Invalid or missing authentication
- 404 Not Found: Snippet not found
- 500 Internal Server Error: Server error

### Get Audio Snippet Metadata
`GET /snippets/{snippet_id}/metadata`

Get metadata of snippet

#### Response (200 OK)
```json
{
    "id": "string",
    "user_id": "string",
    "title": "string",
    "description": "string",
    "audio_url": "string",
    "duration_seconds": "number",
    "status": "pending|processing|completed|failed",
    "spotify_track_id": "string",
    "spotify_artist": "string",
    "spotify_album": "string",
    "created_at": "ISO8601 datetime",
    "updated_at": "ISO8601 datetime"
}
```

#### Error Responses
- 401 Unauthorized: Invalid or missing authentication
- 404 Not Found: Snippet not found
- 500 Internal Server Error: Server error

### Update Snippet Metadata
`PUT /snippets/{snippet_id}`

Updates the metadata of a specific audio snippet.

#### Request Body
```json
{
    "title": "string",
    "description": "string",
    "tags": ["string"],
    "is_public": "boolean"
}
```

#### Response (200 OK)
```json
{
    "id": "string",
    "title": "string",
    "description": "string",
    "tags": ["string"],
    "is_public": "boolean",
    "updated_at": "ISO8601 datetime"
}
```

#### Error Responses
- 400 Bad Request: Invalid input data
- 401 Unauthorized: Invalid or missing authentication
- 404 Not Found: Snippet not found
- 500 Internal Server Error: Server error

## Rate Limiting
- 100 requests per minute per user
- Rate limit headers included in all responses:
  - X-RateLimit-Limit
  - X-RateLimit-Remaining
  - X-RateLimit-Reset

## Error Response Format
All error responses follow this format:
```json
{
    "error": {
        "code": "string",
        "message": "string",
        "details": "object"  // Optional additional error details
    }
}
```